    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.starter\n\n### Question\n\nhi, recently I enabled `mini.starter` in my config. And I used below snippets to disable number and relativenumber when starter opened. But it didn't work. \r\n```lua\r\nvim.api.nvim_create_autocmd(\"User\", {\r\n  pattern = \"MiniStarterOpened\",\r\n  callback = function()\r\n    if vim.bo.filetype == \"ministarter\" then\r\n      local winid = vim.cpi.nvim_get_current_win()\r\n      vim.wo[winid].number = false\r\n      vim.wo[winid].relativenumber = false\r\n    end\r\n  end,\r\n})\r\n```\r\nI also searched in the community, but didn't find a good solution. Does anybody have similar experience? Thank you in advance.",
    "bodyHTML": "<h3 dir=\"auto\">Contributing guidelines</h3>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> I have read <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md\">CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Module(s)</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">mini.starter</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Question</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">hi, recently I enabled <code class=\"notranslate\">mini.starter</code> in my config. And I used below snippets to disable number and relativenumber when starter opened. But it didn't work.</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-lua notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"vim.api.nvim_create_autocmd(&quot;User&quot;, {\n  pattern = &quot;MiniStarterOpened&quot;,\n  callback = function()\n    if vim.bo.filetype == &quot;ministarter&quot; then\n      local winid = vim.cpi.nvim_get_current_win()\n      vim.wo[winid].number = false\n      vim.wo[winid].relativenumber = false\n    end\n  end,\n})\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">api</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">nvim_create_autocmd</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>User<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, {\n  <span class=\"pl-smi\">pattern</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>MiniStarterOpened<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n  <span class=\"pl-en\">callback</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">function</span>()\n    <span class=\"pl-k\">if</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">bo</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">filetype</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">==</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>ministarter<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span><span class=\"pl-k\">then</span>\n      <span class=\"pl-k\">local</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">winid</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">cpi</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">nvim_get_current_win</span>()\n      <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">wo</span>[<span class=\"pl-smi\">winid</span>].<span class=\"pl-e\">number</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">false</span>\n      <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">wo</span>[<span class=\"pl-smi\">winid</span>].<span class=\"pl-e\">relativenumber</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">false</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-k\">end</span>\n  <span class=\"pl-k\">end</span>,\n})</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I also searched in the community, but didn't find a good solution. Does anybody have similar experience? Thank you in advance.</p>",
    "bodyText": "Contributing guidelines\n\n I have read CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md\n\nModule(s)\nmini.starter\nQuestion\nhi, recently I enabled mini.starter in my config. And I used below snippets to disable number and relativenumber when starter opened. But it didn't work.\nvim.api.nvim_create_autocmd(\"User\", {\n  pattern = \"MiniStarterOpened\",\n  callback = function()\n    if vim.bo.filetype == \"ministarter\" then\n      local winid = vim.cpi.nvim_get_current_win()\n      vim.wo[winid].number = false\n      vim.wo[winid].relativenumber = false\n    end\n  end,\n})\nI also searched in the community, but didn't find a good solution. Does anybody have similar experience? Thank you in advance.",
